review:83481_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Go up to the top. But be prepared for the walk up 277 steps!" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Don't try the stairs if you are not in healthy condition or with heavy bags" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "see Tomb of the Unknown Soldier and the eternal flame." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "286 steps to reach the top and will cost 9 euros. No elevator but the view is more than worth it" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "best place for viewing Paris on the top when it nights" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "tempat paling bersejarah di perancis .banyak turis2 mancanegara yang datang kesini .pokoknya kereennnnn .Paris bangeddd ." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Such an iconic gate in Paris !" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Beautiful arch and the best view of Paris from the top!" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Don't fall for the con-men guys who bend down as if to pick up something they've found on the ground (usually a ring which they've just slipped out of their palm), then offer it to you, and ask for $." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Pour une modique somme, on a accès au toit, avec une superbe vue sur l'Axe Historique et la Tour Eiffel." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Suba as escadas! Vale a pena. Se estiver despreparado, suba devagar para não cansar! Custa 9 euros. Desconto se tiver o passe do metro por 3 ou 5 dias." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Depuis 1836, il offre une des plus belle vue de Paris! Admirez l'Axe Historique des Tuileries à la Défense, en passant par les Champs-Élysées. Ou encore la Tour Eiffel et le Sacré Cœur." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Sit at Place de L’etoile square and admire the beautiful monument while the hustle and bustle of Paris passes you by. If you are feeling more adventurous, climb to the top to get a full view of Paris." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "One of my favorite monument in Paris !" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r14 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "My favorite thing in Paris! It's so beautiful and impressive." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r15 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Part of the museum pass. If you are seeing a lot of the items on the list, buy it and save yourself a lot of money and time" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r16 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "muuuchos escalones cansan al subir y marean al bajar :p" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r17 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "muuuchos escalones cansan al subir y marean al bajar :p" ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r18 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "At the end of the illustrious avenue, Champs-elysées, march through the Arc de Triomphe, and proceed to up your credit card debt at the high fashion stores." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r19 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "TRAVEL FACT: The Arc de Triomphe was commissioned by Napoleon in 1806 and memorializes the war heroes of France. Beneath houses the Tomb of the Unknown Solider." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r20 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "One of Paris's most famous sights - you can find similar, but less famous, buildings of the same style in Munich, London, Rome and even Pyongyang." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r21 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Go to the roof at night and watch the light show at the eiffel tower, if you're into that sort of thing." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r22 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "another best places of paris... beautiful lights..." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

review:83481_r23 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Un bien bel arc érigé en l'honneur du triomphe. Et un grand bravo au soldat inconnu tombé ici." ;
    schema:about place:83481 .

