    schema:reviewBody "OMG so many children !" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "It's nearly impossible to see anything from the ships, save for perhaps la tour Eiffel. Better to take the metro." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "So many people on one boat, not normal." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r3 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Experience Paris on a boat on the Seine. Your Eurail Pass entitles you to a 50% discount." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r4 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The dinner trip is a way to go, great way to admire Paris, highly recomended!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r5 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Très drôle et sympa et plein d'infos le commentaire de la promenade. Beaucoup aimé la formule croisière + dîner aux pieds de la Tour Eiffel à 46€. Personnel international très sympa et disponible." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r6 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "A must for lovers. Take a Dinner Cruise and Enjoy one of the Best World Cuisines." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r7 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Fait la croisière Paris Illuminations, service Élégance, très agréable, enchanteur, la cuisine y est bonne et le personnel dispo et super sympa. Une excellente soirée à deux !!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r8 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Do it during sunset... A trip to remember!!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Ignore the comments about too many people if you're here mid September or later. No crowds!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "We know, we know–it’s shamelessly touristy, but there is honestly no better way to see Paris, especially at sunset." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Not worth the money. Have to hold handset to you ear the entire time. Very little descriptions given. Try the hop on and off boat company instead." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Wow! Chocamos!!!!! Nada preocupante aparentemente pero tenemos ya minutos en stop revisando el barco!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r13 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Take a boat and go for a ride at Sena River!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r14 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Lovely experience! Enjoyed the view of all the bridges, ambiance was great, lovely singer on board, food was a bit too cooked but good nevertheless! Worth it for 55 euros." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r15 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "buy your tickets during the day and take the cruise at night. really great advantages of the Eiffel Tower and bridges lit up!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r16 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Try to go at end of day, you will get the better part of the day! Start with sun, and end with moon!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r17 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Have a romantic dinner on a river cruise (such as Bateaux-Mouches) and watch as Paris is lit up as the boat makes its way down the Seine River!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r18 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Great way to spend an hour after walking all day. Audio is a tad hard to hear but it's still worth listening too...Kiss your lover under all 22 bridges!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r19 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "You have to take the tour twice, first all touristy style: photos and stuff. Second time around sunset, go to the back of the boat and your iPod, ignore all tourists and enjoy the show." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r20 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Amis français, ne tombez pas dans cet attrape touriste! Le repas est très moyen, le service express. Seule la balade vaut le coup. Bref, pour 200€ la soirée il y a bien meilleurs endroits pour manger!" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r21 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Da Notre Dame partono meno corse ma c'è meno fila" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r22 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "This place was so awesome. Would love to go back with friends." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r23 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Sympa la balade d'une heure." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r24 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Use the machine and pay with your Visa card you can jump the Que." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r25 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Обязательный для первого дня в Париже - краткий вдохновляющий обзор :-)" ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r26 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Get on the 9 or 10 pm 1 hour cruise! It's timed perfectly to return as the Eiffel Tower lights up. I've taken in twice in two days, and it's heavenly. Best seats are on the outside on the left." ;
    schema:about place:83517 .

review:83517_r27 a schema:Review ;
