    schema:about place:83570 .

review:83570_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "ridiculously awesome taxidermy shop, Discover some (dead) animals you never even heard about before. Skip the museum, just walk around here, it's free." ;
    schema:about place:83570 .

review:83570_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Une boutique de taxidermiste qui est un véritable musée en elle-même ! Des animaux empaillés, des squelettes, des insectes et des papillons en tout genre..." ;
    schema:about place:83570 .

review:83570_r11 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Location Midnight in Paris by Woody Allen. The Surrealist wedding party, where Gil pitches the idea for The Exterminating Angel to a flummoxed Luis Buñuel, is the extraordinary Maison Deyrolle," ;
    schema:about place:83570 .

review:83570_r12 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Location Midnight in Paris (metro: Rue du Bac), awash with insects and taxidermy. Since 1831, Deyrolle has offered animal, botanic and mineral specimens." ;
    schema:about place:83570 .

