review:83785_r29 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Best place to people watch. Arrive just before sun down and enjoy a blend of Parisians and tourists walking the walk." ;
    schema:about place:83785 .

review:83785_r30 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Put on your walking shoes and march down one of the most famous avenues in the world.  This tree lined avenue makes for a beautiful site, come at night when everything is lit up for a romantic walk." ;
    schema:about place:83785 .

review:83785_r31 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The most famous Avenue in the world, you will be delighted discovering amazing boutiques, restaurants, etc. Stop by Le Grand Palais when it's lit up in pink on 10/28 for Breast Cancer Awareness Month." ;
    schema:about place:83785 .

