review:85173_r0 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Maubert-Mutualité is a station on line 10 of the Paris Metro in the 5th arrondissement. It is in the heart of the Latin Quarter and Paris' Left Bank.The station is covered in white tiles like most o" ;
    schema:about place:85173 .

review:85173_r1 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "The station was opened on 15 February 1930 with the extension of line 10 from Odéon to Place d'Italie (now on line line 7). It is named after the Place Maubert (Maubert square)" ;
    schema:about place:85173 .

review:85173_r2 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Sortir ici pour arriver à Mouffetard via la rue de la Montagne Ste Geneviève, comme les Parisiens de l'époque pré-Haussman (et le tracé de la rue Monge)" ;
    schema:about place:85173 .

