review:86935_r9 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Recomendo os passes. €15 dá direito a um dia, quantas paradas quiser. Eiffel, D'orsay, St-Germain dês pres, Notre Dame, Jadin Dês Plantes, Hôtel de Ville, Louvre e champs elysses" ;
    schema:about place:86935 .

review:86935_r10 a schema:Review ;
    schema:author "Anonymous" ;
    schema:reviewBody "Fantastic way to get around and also see gorgeous views of Paris. Get a pass - easy on and off at about 10 major stops along the Siene." ;
